{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"y":-31,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":426,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-31,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]我们村子跟外界封闭，环境不好，生活也不富裕。[r][l]不怕你会觉得我们像一群占山为王的山匪，但算上劫掠，村子也不过只能保证基本的温饱而已。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]你说和驿站合作，为村子提供物资？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]其实……在几年前，兽潮发生的时候，我们也尝试过与外界联手，共同抗灾。[r][l]结果，魔物大军尾随盟友而来，村子几乎全灭。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]自那之后，即便是道理上说得通，也没有人敢再去保证，与外界的交流不会为村子带来危难。[l]连自给自足都无法保证的小聚落，根本没有尝试改变生活方式的成本。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]这就是为什么巴诺姆村至今还如此排外，没有再试着跟任何势力交流。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]但米拉贝尔不一样，她有替村子做出选择，并承担后果，甚至说服村民们的魄力。[r][l]也许她真的可以改变巴诺姆的现状。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":426,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-31,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_014_09-备份","des":"皮塔-封闭的山村"}